      "id": 1350133,
      "name": "[Yuzuha] Tanukis Abound",
      "desc": "When Yuzuha uses <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Assist</color> or launches a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color>, the whole squad gains 5 Energy and 160 Decibels. This effect can trigger once every 12s. When she lands a heavy attack on the enemy with <color=#FFFFFF>Assist Follow-Up</color>, the whole squad's <color=#2BAD00>DMG increases by 15%</color> for 20s, and repeated triggers reset the duration. It also triggers the <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Assist</color> of the previous character. This <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Assist</color> is upgraded to a Chain Attack. This effect can trigger once every 12s.",
